# 项目目录只放代码：素材/中间产物/交付物全部跟着素材目录走
temp/
work/
output/
input/
reports/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# CodeBuddy：agents/rules/skills/commands 是团队资产（入库）；
# 以下是本地运行时产物，不入库
.codebuddy/plans/
.codebuddy/memory/
.codebuddy/sessions/
.codebuddy/history/
.codebuddy/cache/
.codebuddy/logs/

# 本地配置含 LLM api_key，不入库；模板见 config.example.json
config.json
!config.example.json
